{
  "id": "6a863ddb88e562125671f399",
  "title": "Monster(EXO)をLiam(Synthesizer V2)さんに歌ってもらう",
  "created": 1787182665,
  "updated": 1787491148,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a863ddb88e562125671f399",
      "text": "Monster(EXO)をLiam(Synthesizer V2)さんに歌ってもらう",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787182665,
      "updated": 1787182722
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8ab13b00000000005f83d4",
      "text": "[https://open.spotify.com/intl-ja/track/7GbUWl6qLW1gdngbEV2WDJ]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787474235,
      "updated": 1787474235
    },
    {
      "id": "6a863eef0000000000056a72",
      "text": " Cosenseで実況?しながらやる[vlzs.icon]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787182832,
      "updated": 1787183189
    },
    {
      "id": "6a863e810000000000056a65",
      "text": " 以前からやりたいと思っていたけれど、壁が高そうでずっと手につかなかった",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787182722,
      "updated": 1787183140
    },
    {
      "id": "6a863ffc0000000000056a7f",
      "text": " 知人がkpopやkpopの潮流にある国内のアーティストを追っているので、調声をしたあとに送ってみようかな",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787183100,
      "updated": 1787183156
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8640380000000000056a80",
      "text": "  この曲を好きなのは[vlzs.icon]で、その人ではないが",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787183160,
      "updated": 1787183169
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8640410000000000056a81",
      "text": "  好きな曲を教えてもらえるかも",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787183170,
      "updated": 1787183174
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8ab13900000000005f83cf",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787474233,
      "updated": 1787474233
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8ab13800000000005f83ce",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787474233,
      "updated": 1787474233
    },
    {
      "id": "6a863e8f0000000000056a6a",
      "text": "工程",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787182736,
      "updated": 1787182737
    },
    {
      "id": "6a863e8c0000000000056a68",
      "text": " ベタ打ち ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787182733,
      "updated": 1787468096
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8a99460000000000da5852",
      "text": "  [https://scrapbox.io/files/6a8a98d2df81a13e54beef30.mp3]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787468102,
      "updated": 1787468102
    },
    {
      "id": "6a863e910000000000056a6b",
      "text": " 歌詞をコピペで流し込む",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787182738,
      "updated": 1787182759
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8a996d0000000000da5855",
      "text": "  [- 一つのトラックの中で複数の言語を選択することはできない？]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787468141,
      "updated": 1787468190
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8a99470000000000da5853",
      "text": "  [- 複数の言語が曲中で交じるとき、それぞれの言語で別のトラックを用意する必要がある？]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787468104,
      "updated": 1787468192
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8a996f0000000000da5856",
      "text": "  Noteごとに指定できた。そりゃそうか",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787468144,
      "updated": 1787473274
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8aad7a0000000000a220f4",
      "text": "  韓国語のIMEの`ㅓㅏㅗㅜ`のキー配列は図形的に覚えやすくて助かる",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787473274,
      "updated": 1787490122
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8aadbe0000000000a220f7",
      "text": "   レイヤーでカスタムされたキーマップのchordで入力するときの↑↓←→の配置みたいになってた",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787473342,
      "updated": 1787473390
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8ab0fc00000000005f83cc",
      "text": "  韓国語のタイピングに時間がかかるので打ち込みに時間がかかる",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787474172,
      "updated": 1787474191
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8ab10300000000005f83cd",
      "text": "   タイピング作業を分離して取り出して、タイピングゲームで鍛えよう",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787474179,
      "updated": 1787474209
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8aef0e0000000000389e6a",
      "text": "  ピッチがぶれぶれになる",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787490063,
      "updated": 1787490072
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8aef160000000000389e6b",
      "text": "   [https://gyazo.com/d797d5ef9009eb0577fa5937746c0fdd]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787490072,
      "updated": 1787490118
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8aef440000000000389e6c",
      "text": "    こういうの",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787490118,
      "updated": 1787490126
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8aef4d0000000000389e6d",
      "text": "   Note > Expression を中心からRigidに変更したら平らになった",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787490126,
      "updated": 1787490159
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8aef6f0000000000389e6e",
      "text": "   Note > Vibrato Modulationの値を小さくすることでも平らになった",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787490159,
      "updated": 1787490186
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8aef890000000000389e6f",
      "text": "    これはビブラートだ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787490186,
      "updated": 1787490194
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8af17d0000000000389e70",
      "text": "  줘のㅈ ㅜ ㅓって[- 2重母音？]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787490685,
      "updated": 1787490794
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8af1de0000000000389e72",
      "text": "   子音の連なりだった",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787490782,
      "updated": 1787490798
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8af1ee0000000000389e73",
      "text": "   左手で二回連続で入力するのが変な感じ、左手→右手→左手でない",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787490798,
      "updated": 1787490813
    },
    {
      "id": "6a863eb90000000000056a70",
      "text": " 音素タイミングとかピッチの曲線を耳で整える",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787182777,
      "updated": 1787182842
    },
    {
      "id": "6a863eaa0000000000056a6e",
      "text": " (ここで一旦完成)",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787182762,
      "updated": 1787182769
    },
    {
      "id": "6a86405b0000000000056a82",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787183195,
      "updated": 1787183195
    },
    {
      "id": "6a863fdd0000000000056a7d",
      "text": "ハングルを把握してからもう一回",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787183071,
      "updated": 1787183077
    },
    {
      "id": "6a863fb20000000000056a78",
      "text": " ハングルを使えるようになりたい",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787183027,
      "updated": 1787183033
    },
    {
      "id": "6a863e930000000000056a6c",
      "text": "  韓国語の子音と母音を把握",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787182739,
      "updated": 1787183026
    },
    {
      "id": "6a863e9c0000000000056a6d",
      "text": "  発音しながら書く",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787182749,
      "updated": 1787182911
    },
    {
      "id": "6a863f0f0000000000056a73",
      "text": "  Duolingoとcakeを一ヶ月ぐらいやる",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787182911,
      "updated": 1787183016
    },
    {
      "id": "6a863fa80000000000056a77",
      "text": "   単語や表現を覚えるつもりでやったら、土台として使うハングルも覚えられるはず",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787183016,
      "updated": 1787183044
    },
    {
      "id": "6a863f4a0000000000056a74",
      "text": "  目標はハングルを見たら音がわかる時点までにする",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787182922,
      "updated": 1787182962
    },
    {
      "id": "6a863f720000000000056a76",
      "text": "   韓国語の動画などを見たときに聞き取れるのが将来の目標",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787182963,
      "updated": 1787491148
    },
    {
      "id": "6a863e8f0000000000056a69",
      "text": " 歌詞を手打ちで流し込む",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787182735,
      "updated": 1787183081
    },
    {
      "id": "6a863fcb0000000000056a7a",
      "text": " もういっかい調声する",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787183051,
      "updated": 1787183082
    },
    {
      "id": "6a863eb30000000000056a6f",
      "text": " (ここで完成)",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787182772,
      "updated": 1787183085
    },
    {
      "id": "6a863fc90000000000056a79",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787183050,
      "updated": 1787183089
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8640610000000000056a83",
      "text": "インストをコピーしてもう一回",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787183201,
      "updated": 1787183535
    },
    {
      "id": "6a86406c0000000000056a84",
      "text": " 上までの違法ダウンロードしたオケで歌ってもらったものは動画サイトには投稿できなさそうだけど",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787183213,
      "updated": 1787183275
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8640bd0000000000056a89",
      "text": "  それとも、公開しているインストの使用は見つけないでもらえるものかな",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787183294,
      "updated": 1787183316
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8640d50000000000056a8a",
      "text": "  何を目的にインストを公開しているんだろう",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787183318,
      "updated": 1787183326
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8640aa0000000000056a87",
      "text": " インストを耳コピで作成したら投稿できそう",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787183275,
      "updated": 1787183283
    },
    {
      "id": "6a863fdb0000000000056a7c",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787183071,
      "updated": 1787183071
    }
  ]
}